%!PS
% Test content for poem.ps: the least it takes (one short note, no attribution
% line, a short reading); paper theme.
% After Yosa Buson's spring sea haiku: a literal rendering written for this test.
% `psanim check poem-buson.ps` runs poem.ps with this content.
/tpl (poem.ps) component
/film /tpl << /Params <<
  /look /paper
  /heading (Spring sea)
  /poet ()
  /poem [ (the spring sea) (all day long, rising, falling,) (rising, falling) ]
  /notes [ [ 2 (rising, falling) (sound) (The words repeat like waves.) ] ]
  /reading (A whole day in one slow motion.)
>> >> instance
<< /Size [1280 720] /Duration /film componentduration /FPS 30 >> animation
/scene { /film << /After /hold >> place } def
